~ start
if (!GlobalPlayer.get_bool_flag(&"bLanaMet")):
	=>< intro
else:
	Lana: [#happy] Hey Midnight! Thanks for playing the Spells & Stuff demo for Midnight Dungeons!
Lana: You've completed all of the available dungeons in this demo, you're free to go!
Lana: [#sideeye] Unless you're on the trail of a secret...
if (GlobalPlayer.get_flag(&"iEvilScore") > 0):
	Lana: You are?
	Lana: [#happy] Amazing! Tell me more!
	- Errors? => error
	- Nothing...
		Lana: That's fine.
		Lana: [#happy] Feel free to tell me when you're ready!
		=> END
Lana: In which case, chase away!
=> END

~ intro
Lana: ...
Lana: [#happy] Oh! I forgot!
Lana: You haven't met me yet, but you will soon!
Lana: [#sideeye] Well, now too I suppose...
Lana: I mean in the next build of...
Lana: [#sideeye] Midnight... [font_size=8]dungeons...[/font_size]
Lana: [#skeptical] ...
Midnight: [#confused] ...?
Lana: Anyways...
Lana: My name is Lana, and I'm your guild representative!
Lana: Once the guild starts existing... I'll be the one to help you get in and hopefully *not* get kicked out.
Lana: [#sideeye] [font_size=8]Because humans don't particularly like beasts.[/font_size]
Midnight: [#surprised] ?!
Lana: Yeah... 
Lana: You'll have to wait for the next build to get more of that story!
$> GlobalPlayer.set_bool_flag(&"bLanaMet", true)
=> END

~ error
ERROR: [#lana] Once more you meet, it stares at you through the face of its mentor.
ERROR: [#lana] Does it believe you have the strength?
ERROR: [#lana] ...
if GlobalPlayer.get_flag(&"iEvilScore") < 3:
	ERROR: [#lana] Well, you'll be meeting soon enough.
	ERROR: [#lana] Only {{3 - GlobalPlayer.get_flag(&"iEvilScore")}} more times...
else:
	ERROR: [#lana] Though, you should've already met.
	ERROR: [#lana] Through the bottom of its world sits yours.
	ERROR: [#lana] Perhaps it should visit?
=> END
